TITLE FlahaX calcite equilibrium allocation probe
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 8.5
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 1
    C 1 as HCO3
    Na 2
    Cl 2
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0.1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_allocation_probe.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -ionic_strength true
    -totals Ca C
    -si Calcite
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
